            "\n",
            "Experiments show that fine-tuning an 11B-parameter T5 model \\cite{2020t5} on \\ours{} can outperform both T0++ \\cite{sanh2021multitask} and Tk-Instruct \\cite{supernaturalinstructions} across several benchmarks, including Super-Natural Instructions \\cite{supernaturalinstructions}, BIG-bench Hard \\cite{bbh}, and LMentry \\cite{lmentry}.\n",
