            "\\subsection{Two-Step Process}\n",
            "\n",
            "An alternative to our two-step pipeline is to generate instruction-input-output triplets in one pass. To test this approach, we provide the model with the same prompt used for the instruction-input-constraints generation, only with an additional \\textit{output} field, added after the constraints field. As Table~\\ref{table:constraint-ablations} shows, one-step generation obtains a score that is lower by 1.7 than the default two-step process.\n",
